108	/// `[tool.uv.workspace]` -- both use the identical members/exclude
109	/// glob-array shape, including a root manifest that is itself both a
110	/// package/project and a workspace root (hybrid root). `NpmMembership`
111	/// deliberately does NOT go through this type: npm's shape genuinely
112	/// differs (JSON not TOML, no `exclude` concept, and a pnpm-workspace.yaml
113	/// fallback with its own precedence rules).
